Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:19.00,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:23.46,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Then again, I guess that's off the table, \Nconsidering he was drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:28.23,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Dammit! What the hell do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:35.30,main,Set,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.65,0:02:10.03,sign_harsh_red,ePTITLE sign,0,0,0,,{\fade(400,400\blur1)\pos(471.282,285)\c&H0E00DD&}The Girl of Wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:14.28,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,Where's Fate?! Bring out the sacrifice—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.02,main,Village Chief,0,0,0,,Someone help—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.50,main,Set,0,0,0,,Now spit it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:21.27,main,Set,0,0,0,,Here's some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:22.25,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:26.67,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,An antidote, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:28.97,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,This village really does know its herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:31.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Where...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:32.55,main,Set,0,0,0,,We're in my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:35.63,main,Set,0,0,0,,You were drugged and put to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:37.09,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Drugged?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.09,0:02:39.81,main,Set,0,0,0,,It was my father's doing. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Stay inside the house, Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:52.40,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What a nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.75,0:03:05.80,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We're in trouble if they \Nkeep taking shots at us from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:16.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,They're level 27,\N with Fireball as their skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:16.01,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(146.59,86.619)}[Stats]
