Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:16.01,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\pos(146.59,256.586)}[Skills]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:16.01,sign_harsh_red,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(312.572,281.257)}Fireball
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:18.71,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That skill could spell trouble. \NUse the great scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:19.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.43,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:48.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I thought it was supposed to \Ncut through the ephemeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:52.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, it cut the magic, but the fire \Nthat it causes is a whole separate issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.99,0:03:54.45,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.45,0:03:57.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I think they do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:01.77,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,They're going for blanket fire now \Ninstead of just hitting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.30,0:04:03.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:07.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How they like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:22.77,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:25.52,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,The skill Fireball has been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:26.87,main,Fate,0,0,0,,That leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:31.61,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Just the leader, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:38.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Level 47... His skills are Fireball \Nand Fire Resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(146.59,86.619)}[Stats]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(146.59,114.053)}Vitality:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(146.59,140.545)}Strength:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H090203&\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\pos(146.59,165.942)}Magic:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(146.59,194.983)}Spirit:
