Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(317.603,253.233)}Fireball
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:38.51,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\fs15\pos(317.602,269.042)}Fire Resistance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.82,0:04:43.47,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Fate, he's gonna close in \Nto hit you with that Fireball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:44.98,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That'll be your chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.48,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.24,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Increasing stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:06.19,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,The skill Fire Resistance \Nhas been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.24,main,Set,0,0,0,,My dad's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:16.65,main,Set,0,0,0,,Only a few villagers survived, including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:19.13,main,Set,0,0,0,,The village is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:20.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.79,0:05:23.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This land is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:26.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The soil isn't healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:29.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You won't be able to grow anything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:32.19,main,Set,0,0,0,,Fate... you can use Identify?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:33.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:36.99,main,Set,0,0,0,,Then why do something dangerous \Nlike being a warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:39.39,main,Set,0,0,0,,You could earn your living with Identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:46.48,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Gluttony... a skill that defies divine law.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:57.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.91,0:06:02.48,main,Set,0,0,0,,I'm gonna look for a job in town...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.09,main,Set,0,0,0,,For my daughter's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.47,0:06:25.45,main,Set,0,0,0,,Look, Fate. I want you to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.49,main,Set,0,0,0,,I want to pay for what I did. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.35,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Let him have it, Fate. \NIt'll help him feel even.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:34.50,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:36.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Set, grit your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.71,main,Set,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:44.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, that was too hard! \NYou total oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.31,0:06:44.63,top,Fate,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.23,0:06:47.13,main,Set,0,0,0,,Thanks, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:48.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Y-You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:50.58,main,Set,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:54.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Look after your daughter, Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:58.40,main,Set,0,0,0,,I will. Take care, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:11.79,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,As bad as this village was, \NI hate to see it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:17.33,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,But... the memories of my time \Nhere with Dad aren't gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:25.08,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be fine from now on, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:35.19,main,Miria,0,0,0,,We're nearly to Lanchester \Nterritory, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.19,0:07:38.31,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,Yes. Once we get there, \Nwe'll see about resupplying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.02,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Be careful around the lord \Nof Lanchester, Lady Roxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.67,0:07:45.04,main,Roxy,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Mugan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.04,0:07:46.59,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,You'll see when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:48.48,main,Miria,0,0,0,,He's holding out on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:51.65,main,Miria,0,0,0,,That's cheap, Mugan! Cheap, cheap, cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.66,main,Miria,0,0,0,,Cheapskate old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:55.15,main,Mugan,0,0,0,,Would you stop saying cheap?! \NYou're not a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:00.42,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:05.20,main,Driver,0,0,0,,I see you yawning back there. \NAre you guarding me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:06.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.76,0:08:10.97,main,Driver,0,0,0,,I'm paying you three gold coins, here. \NI'm counting on you if things get rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:13.34,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Guy thinks he's hot stuff \Nfor three gold coins...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:19.74,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I may not look it, but I can fight decently. \NAbout as well as a rookie holy knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.22,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Bold claim!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.23,main,Driver,0,0,0,,That's a relief to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:25.23,main,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,You in the carriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:31.16,main,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the road's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:34.92,main,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna die, \Nleave everything of value behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:36.53,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:38.79,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Hold it! You'll have to deal with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:42.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,See? You should've asked for more pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.90,0:08:45.35,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You always live up to your name, Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:48.45,main,Driver,0,0,0,,S-S-Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.45,0:08:49.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What the—?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.30,0:08:50.93,main,Driver,0,0,0,,You're strong, aren't you, mister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:52.82,main,Driver,0,0,0,,You gotta do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:56.31,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Just get off of me! I can't fight like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:56.31,top,Driver,0,0,0,,I got a wife, a six-year-old, \Nand a seven-year-old at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.73,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Save me! Don't run off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.81,main,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Look there, boys, the prey's \Nshaking in his boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:03.83,main,Bandit 1,0,0,0,,Let's take 'em down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:19.16,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I only know one person \Nwho could pull that off...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.43,0:09:22.71,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.81,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's you... from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:30.35,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You owe me for those kobolds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:34.78,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I could use a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:37.93,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Sure. Considering you\Nhelped us... Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The carriage tipped over?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:50.86,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Sloth, go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:55.50,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The weight of her weapon changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:59.68,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Didn't get your name yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:01.22,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's Fate Graphite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:05.62,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Fate of Gluttony. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How do you know about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.26,0:10:11.97,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I have a Skill of Deadly Sin, too. \NOf course I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:13.69,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Skill of Deadly Sin...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.51,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Did Greed not tell you about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.15,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Greed...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:21.83,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I'm Myne of Wrath. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.83,0:10:23.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wrath...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:25.79,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Want some jerky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:42.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Huh? Whoa—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.93,0:10:44.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Don't eat all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:49.29,main,Fate,0,0,0,,My share...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.57,0:10:53.83,main,Driver,0,0,0,,We're almost in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:05.35,main,Girl,0,0,0,,Someone, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:08.83,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Rest easy, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:12.19,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,I will deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.14,main,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,We're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:25.91,main,Girl,0,0,0,,How gallant! What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:32.09,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,I am none other than the lord \Nof Lanchester, Rudolph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.47,0:11:36.17,main,Women,0,0,0,,Sir Rudolph! You're so wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:39.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,What kind of sideshow is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:44.52,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Looks like Sir Rudolph is preparing \Nto welcome the expedition to Galia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:47.12,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Do you mean the one led by Lady Roxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:50.14,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Yeah! They should be coming to town soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:51.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean—?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:54.66,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You were running after her\Nand ended up passing her by!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:59.69,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Considering the numbers \Nand supplies they're packing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:01.89,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,it makes sense they'd be slower.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:06.33,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Here you are, the three \Ngold coins I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:08.42,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I'll take those.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:10.38,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.28,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Greedy jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:13.81,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Well, that's ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.81,0:12:15.33,main,Driver,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:16.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:19.13,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now, then... what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.84,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Guess we should find somewhere to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:21.59,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:25.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Whoa—Don't fall asleep on your feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:29.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How did I end up doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:33.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Give it up. She's not exactly \Na morning person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.54,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You seem pretty well acquainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:39.86,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The quiet act again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:43.50,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Shhh! Or people are gonna think you're \Nsome weirdo who talks to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.97,0:12:46.20,main,Citizen 1,0,0,0,,Welcome to Lanchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:49.94,main,Citizen 2,0,0,0,,Our great lord, Sir Rudolph, welcomes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:57.37,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Do they revere the holy knights \Nin this town...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.85,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What are those symbols?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:04.55,main,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,Travelers can't pass any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:07.24,main,Soldier 2,0,0,0,,Only citizens can enter past here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.27,main,Soldier 1,0,0,0,,You'll find lodging over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:12.44,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,They've got a different mark \Non their neck than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:15.69,main,Have-Not,0,0,0,,Welcome to Lanchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:19.21,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,Another different mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:22.49,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,What is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:25.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Most likely different social classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:29.37,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like the lord here doesn't even pretend\Nthat they're not on a caste system.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:33.37,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The people must truly love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.01,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Is that what it is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.86,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,That was your idea of a ceremony?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:44.26,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,That was no way to convey how great \NI... no, the Lanchester family is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:49.02,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,The whole point of this is to \Ndemonstrate our superiority to the Harts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:51.04,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Are you trying to humiliate me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.04,0:13:53.10,main,Soldier 3,0,0,0,,Please, forgive us, Sir Rudo—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:58.42,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,You're that warrior who ran off \Nduring a monster hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:03.86,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,Worthless fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:07.05,main,Soldier 4,0,0,0,,Two in one day... He's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.61,main,Soldier 5,0,0,0,,If we upset Sir Rudolph,\Nwe'll end up dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.71,main,Fate,0,0,0,,She really is a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.05,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I didn't expect her to still be alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:21.60,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:25.14,main,Fate,0,0,0,,How do you know Myne anyway, Greed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.14,0:14:28.33,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We're old acquaintances who keep \Nrunning into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.33,0:14:30.45,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That also goes for Sloth, over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:32.02,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne's axe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:35.67,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Yeah. Sloth is like me—\Na Weapon of Mortal Sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:40.47,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Myne mentioned something \Nabout Skills of Deadly Sin, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.47,0:14:41.78,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What is all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:47.20,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I guess it's time that you \Nactually learn about them, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:49.70,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gluttony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:51.16,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:52.62,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}Greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.08,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.54,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:57.01,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:14:58.46,top,Greed,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:01.86,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,These skills were born by defying \Nthe laws put forth by the divine...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:05.53,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Which is why they are called the Skills\Nof Deadly Sin and Weapons of Mortal Sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.53,0:15:09.18,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Among them, Gluttony \Nis particularly sinful
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:13.61,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,for having the potential to\Noverturn the divine system of leveling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:15.73,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Sin... so that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:19.48,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Once Gluttony tasted souls, \Nthere was no stopping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:21.85,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And that's my punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:26.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,We all have to pay,\Nin one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:28.32,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Same goes for Myne.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.28,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why me, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.87,0:15:33.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I get mocked, made a fool of,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.39,0:15:36.67,main,Fate,0,0,0,,for a useless skill that just \Nmakes me hungry all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:40.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,And just when I think \NI had gained some power,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.11,0:15:42.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I have to keep killing to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.88,0:15:44.76,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What good even is this power?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.76,0:15:49.11,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Whoa, now, that kind of emotional \Ndisturbance could cost you, someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.11,0:15:50.22,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Maybe even today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:54.09,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,If your mind isn't resilient, \NGluttony will take it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:56.97,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You need to get strong \Nenough to resist, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:59.44,main,Fate,0,0,0,,The strength to resist...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:02.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The trick is to sustain \Na state of near-starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:04.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.68,0:16:09.74,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Listen up. Don't satisfy \NGluttony all at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.57,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You'll wanna slowly get your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:12.70,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:16.02,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,A Sandman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:17.91,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Okay, let's try this out on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.74,0:16:23.95,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Cast Fireball before you fire the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.95,0:16:24.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.34,0:16:29.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:32.30,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I can add the Fireball skill \Nto the magic arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:34.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:39.83,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:41.15,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:43.18,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Another sandman, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.52,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You have to suck it up, Fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.61,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Whoa, even more sandmen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:50.44,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.58,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This is gonna be a long night...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:01.06,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.96,0:17:11.68,main,Myne,0,0,0,,"Whoever defeats the sand \Ngolem will be rewarded."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:17.64,main,Old man,0,0,0,,Even Sir Rudolph can't slay the sand golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:21.56,main,Old man,0,0,0,,But if it isn't defeated, \Nthen only death awaits...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.20,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:30.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Looks like you're getting the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.36,0:17:34.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Feels a bit like only drinking a drop \Nof water at a time in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:36.42,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,I guess it's time to satisfy Gluttony, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:38.59,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Don't want you going nuts, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.31,0:17:42.22,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This scent... there's \Na Crowned Beast nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:44.79,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That'll make a fine main dish for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.04,main,Warrior 3,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.75,main,Warrior 2,0,0,0,,Leave us and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:51.53,main,Bard,0,0,0,,We can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:54.34,main,Warrior 4,0,0,0,,But how do we stop this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:17:58.14,main,Bard,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,This monster is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.44,main,Bard,0,0,0,,Hey! You can't beat this thing on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:10.40,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Playing hero again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:11.15,main,Fate,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.32,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm just getting my fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(230.281,20.419)}Eye of the Sandstorm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(148.746,108.535)}[Stats]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(148.746,135.969)}Vitality:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(148.746,162.461)}Strength:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H090203&\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\pos(148.746,187.858)}Magic:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(148.746,216.899)}Spirit:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(148.746,245.883)}Agility:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H090203&\fade(500,1)\pos(148.746,278.502)}[Skills]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.07,sign_harsh_red,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(500,1)\3c&H090203&\pos(317.602,297.066)}Sandstorm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:38.36,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,That's Sandstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:41.71,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Once he pulls you in, \Nhe'll crush you with rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:44.68,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Fine, then. I'll cut \Nthrough him and his spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:45.98,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Great scythe, Greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.15,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Changing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:49.11,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:57.39,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Now we'll cut him apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.39,0:18:58.62,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,End it, Fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.53,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:04.54,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,The core's gone inside the sand! \NDon't let it get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.21,0:19:14.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Bloody Ptarmigan, Greed!\NTake your 10%!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:16.63,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Not enough! I'll need 20% for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:19.19,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Fine! And take some fire while you're at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.19,0:19:20.47,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Oh, gladly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.87,0:19:34.27,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,Gluttony skill has activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:37.12,italics,Voice,0,0,0,,The skill Sandstorm has been added.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.69,0:19:42.51,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What a mess...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:45.27,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,There was no other way to win. \NIt is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:48.04,main,Bard,0,0,0,,That was really something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:51.43,main,Bard,0,0,0,,I've never seen a warrior that \Ncould do something like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:54.37,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Pretty shady looking, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:59.19,main,Bard,0,0,0,,You really did save us, though. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:02.10,main,Fate,0,0,0,,It's fine. Just lending a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:05.31,main,Bard,0,0,0,,I'm Bard. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:08.27,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm Corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:11.22,main,Bard,0,0,0,,Is that all of your gear, Corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:14.72,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Yeah. You think I should get some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:17.04,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You won't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.04,0:20:21.28,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You can steal enemy skills \Nand increase your stats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:23.98,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Most people can't, so they need equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:29.05,italics,Fate,0,0,0,,The power to defy \Nthe concept of levels, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:40.84,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Why aren't you wearing anything, \NMyne?! Get dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:44.61,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You're just a kid, Fate. \NWhy would I be embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:49.00,main,Myne,0,0,0,,You're having dirty thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:50.26,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.19,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,You two are hitting it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.17,main,Fate,0,0,0,,You going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.11,main,Myne,0,0,0,,Hunting the sand golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:58.82,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I already took it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.07,0:21:02.20,main,Myne,0,0,0,,My reward...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:04.03,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Calm down, Myne! You can have half!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:09.00,main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,Mr. Corpse? Your 100 gold coin reward \Nfor defeating the sand golem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.83,0:21:10.97,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.71,0:21:14.07,main,Myne,0,0,0,,What's with the mask? Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:17.42,main,Fate,0,0,0,,I fought as Corpse, so I have to \Ncollect the reward as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:21.13,main,Receptionist,0,0,0,,Sir Rudolph?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:24.85,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,You're Corpse, the one \Nwho defeated the Sand Golem?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.50,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,You serve me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.89,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.01,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,You have no right to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.01,0:21:35.61,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,When a holy knight makes a decision, \Nothers must simply obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:38.77,main,Myne,0,0,0,,That won't do. He was mine first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.57,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:44.78,main,Rudolph,0,0,0,,A fresh little girl like you is better off \Nat home sucking on your mother's—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:50.93,main,Fate,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.93,0:21:52.46,main,Myne,0,0,0,,I am not a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.46,0:21:55.31,italics,Greed,0,0,0,,Well, this is definitely gonna be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.31,0:21:57.05,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We need to get out of town \Nwhile we have the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.05,0:21:58.88,main,Fate,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:02.18,main,Fate,0,0,0,,We need a ride!
